  "sourceTitle": "Mango Fool",
  "sourceText": "Mango Fool\nBy: Sheri Wetherell\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:35am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 cups mango puree\n1 tablespoon Lime juice\n1/2 cup Sugar\n3 cups whipped cream, chilled\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine mango puree, lime juice and sugar; chill thoroughly. Just before serving, fold in whipped cream. Blend lightly so that mixture has streaks of cream and mango.",
